  "text": "proprium.omnium-sanctorum-postcommunio",
  "about": "The postcommunio of the formulary “All Saints” in the 1962 Roman Missal.",
  "segments": {
    "s01": { "translation": "Grant Your faithful people, we beseech You, O Lord, ever to rejoice in the veneration of all the Saints, and to be protected by their unceasing prayers. Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Thy Son, who liveth and reigneth with Thee in the unity of the Holy Ghost, God, world without end. Amen." }
